{
  "reason": "B1.1: 3 one-off tasks of one shape",
  "extend": {
    "add_services": [
      {
        "owner": "lead",
        "name": "one-page-ops",
        "description": "One-off request from the user (not the weekly-meeting-memo service, no new agents): from the notes file /tmp/hirearchy-p2/R1-1793275867/notes/2026-10-05.md make a one-page action list for the ops team. Each action with its owner and due date; at most one page. The user's words: \"a one-page action l…",
